      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "id": "n",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 633.6,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "[1, 2, 3] itself never changes: a value that another variable, a field\nor a process holds is the same as before. Only the name a moves.\nOn a temporary, b.items.pop or [1, 2].push(3), there is no name to move,\nand the checker still rejects it.",
      "originalText": "[1, 2, 3] itself never changes: a value that another variable, a field\nor a process holds is the same as before. Only the name a moves.\nOn a temporary, b.items.pop or [1, 2].push(3), there is no name to move,\nand the checker still rejects it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
